# Sensitive architecture and security docs

# W11-MIG-011: monorepo build outputs for the imported contracts and frontend
# trees. Cargo targets alone can reach hundreds of megabytes, and Next.js /
# Playwright caches are regenerated locally, so none of them belong in git.
contracts/target/
frontend/.next/
frontend/out/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/test-results/
target/
*.wasm
.next/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Audit artifacts
audit/reports/*.tmp
audit/reports/*.log
!audit/reports/*.txt
!audit/reports/*.json
!audit/reports/last-run.txt
config.bat
